import lib/ui_native.dl
import examples/ribbon/interface.dl
import examples/ribbon/workspace.dl

set state to a new ribbon demo state
set interface to an instance of ribbon studio with state (the address of state)
bind (the control labeled "Editor" in (the address of interface)) in (the address of interface) to (the function named "paint the ribbon workspace on $") for event 1
set view to a native view of (the address of interface) sized 1280 by 800 using fonts "tests/games/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "tests/games/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
set state's view to the address of view
loop while view's window remains open:
    render the address of view
    if the UI close key was pressed in (the address of view):
        request that view's window close
    sleep for 4 milliseconds
close the address of view
close the address of interface
